/-!
# Cofinal pair causality written by the actual endpoint macro

The endpoint macro already writes the complete native component-occurrence
stream before any Fourier-output or input-pair quotient.  Finite accumulation
independently generates a cofinal lineage of nonzero pair Duhamel receipts.
This module identifies every generated pair event with its literal coordinate
in that existing endpoint ledger and retains, on the same receipt, both exact
relation compilers:

* pair plus swap is the physical velocity-pair curl;
* reflected kinetic work closes up to the causal heat commutator.

Consequently a vanishing scalar commutator does not erase the event: the
original nonzero pair still writes its native next-pair keep or causal trace.
The physical projection remains the already generated unforced endpoint
successor.  No event index, pair, branch, target, continuation, nonzero
witness, or faithfulness certificate is supplied by the caller.
-/

